ta-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><munderover><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∑</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>24.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
