 data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
